   "website": "Grab your Halloween costumes, get howling, and get hyped up for a brand-new race! Are you ready to throw on your favorite costume and hustle (or walk or stroll) through the Memphis Zoo and Overton Park? This fun-filled morning brings families, friends, and racers together for a brand new 5k experience next to some of your favorite animals, Halloween characters, and fun Halloween themed photo ops. The fun ends with a festive post-race celebration inside the Zoo featuring live music, a costume contest, and Halloween fun for all ages. Best of all, race registration includes Zoo admission, so you can keep the fun going long after you cross the finish line. Your registration includes everything listed HERE NEW! Race from ANYWHERE! Our virtual run lets you run from anywhere if you can\u2019t join us in person, and it includes your own medal, T-shirt, and downloadable race bib. $50 for virtual racers. Members: $60 per person Non-members: $70 per person Saturday, October 24, 2026 (registration for in person closes October 19th and registration for virtual closes October 24th) 7:30am All ages Contact zooinfo@memphiszoo.org Register Now",
